 14	 * Branch-already-exists handling (re-claim or blocked recovery):
 15	 *   - blocked_context null:  interrupted prior claim — checkout + reset to origin/<branch>.
 16	 *   - blocked_context non-null: blocked recovery path — return branch_blocked_recovery.
 17	 *
 18	 * Pre-commit jitter (50–500 ms, bounded by jitter_max_seconds) de-synchronises agents
 19	 * that pull from the same cron tick and reduces the collision rate.
 20	 */
